<title>GERMANY: Allianz details final 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Allianz details final 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   2,238   vs 2,021</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     4,164   vs 3,043</p>
<p>    Group underwriting earnings	   148 loss vs 684 loss</p>
<p>    Group non-underwriting profit	  4,312   vs 3,727</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share(DVFA)*	9.25    vs 8,72 marks</p>
<p>    Gross premiums			     74,630  vs 70,548</p>
<p>    Investments under management	   344,200 vs 282,000</p>
<p>    Own capital				  20,356  vs 18,481</p>
<p>    After tax return on equity	     11.5    vs 11.2 pct</p>
<p>    Staff					  65,836  vs 69,236</p>
<p>    Dividend (already reported)	    1.70    vs 1.60 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer is Allianz AG Holding. All results were released in preliminary form in February. *Earnings per share are adjusted to reflect Allianz's switch this year to a five mark par value from from a 50-mark par value.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
